{"3132870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DarkSwitch", "steam_appid": 3132870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4227220], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Tree Provides, The Tree Protects, The Tree Prevails!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DarkSwitch is a vertical survival city builder set in the boughs of a gigantic tree. Defend your leafy home against the perils of the creeping fog by managing light and flame.<strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources</strong>, <strong>research technologies</strong>, and send pioneers to explore the ruins of those who came before: discover their secrets and doom.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world of folk horror and creeping dread, DarkSwitch blends vertical <strong>city-building</strong>, <strong>tower defense</strong>, and <strong>exploration</strong> into a unique strategic experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a stunning, dangerous, dark fantasy world enriched by cinematic cutscenes and an atmospheric soundtrack from Silent Hill composer <strong>Akira Yamaoka</strong>!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/d646e19d8a2b5a3efc59cd0e4b6ebb12.poster.avif?t=1784727657\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/d646e19d8a2b5a3efc59cd0e4b6ebb12.webm?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/d646e19d8a2b5a3efc59cd0e4b6ebb12.mp4?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your city upwards, utilizing both trunk and bough.</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited horizontal space</strong> requires a strategy; construct zip lines and stairways to connect your growing settlement layers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage raw and processed resources</strong>, production facilities, and citizen morale, while fortifying defenses to withstand fog's creeping chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/871c795c3c6049086c1db1af8bd1a321.poster.avif?t=1784727657\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/871c795c3c6049086c1db1af8bd1a321.webm?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/871c795c3c6049086c1db1af8bd1a321.mp4?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fog  drives your citizens to madness and conceals stalking terrors.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight back by illuminating paths, crafting light-powered weapons</strong>, and mastering the raw energy of Solium.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push back the gloom</strong> and save your nation. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/e4866f37018a6946872b298b08213ed4.poster.avif?t=1784727657\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/e4866f37018a6946872b298b08213ed4.webm?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/e4866f37018a6946872b298b08213ed4.mp4?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Send scout detachments into the misty unknown to chart new airship routes.</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish far-outposts, and excavate rare resources and artifacts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange and lethal creatures lurking in the fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the remnants of an ancient civilization. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/519083327560fcfac200b237b4af9bac.poster.avif?t=1784727657\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/519083327560fcfac200b237b4af9bac.webm?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/519083327560fcfac200b237b4af9bac.mp4?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Shape your citizens' destiny through morally complex decisions</strong>. </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness various dramatic storylines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate choices where even small actions can spiral into grim consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/1764305358c5c248e2843cb270b4ed49.avif?t=1784727657\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode: 20+ hours</strong> of single-player, story-driven gameplay with quests, branching narratives, and high-stakes choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ unique buildings</strong> for full tree city customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 resource types</strong>: balance raw and processed goods to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 technology levels</strong> to advance and unlock new growth possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200-meter-tall tree</strong> that serves as the foundation for your city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric soundtrack </strong>composed by <strong>Akira Yamaoka</strong> (<i>Silent Hill</i> series).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/606c518046f94120af41c043fcb1290e.poster.avif?t=1784727657\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/606c518046f94120af41c043fcb1290e.webm?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Tree Provides, The Tree Protects, The Tree Prevails!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DarkSwitch is a vertical survival city builder set in the boughs of a gigantic tree. Defend your leafy home against the perils of the creeping fog by managing light and flame.<strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources</strong>, <strong>research technologies</strong>, and send pioneers to explore the ruins of those who came before: discover their secrets and doom.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world of folk horror and creeping dread, DarkSwitch blends vertical <strong>city-building</strong>, <strong>tower defense</strong>, and <strong>exploration</strong> into a unique strategic experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a stunning, dangerous, dark fantasy world enriched by cinematic cutscenes and an atmospheric soundtrack from Silent Hill composer <strong>Akira Yamaoka</strong>!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/d646e19d8a2b5a3efc59cd0e4b6ebb12.poster.avif?t=1784727657\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/d646e19d8a2b5a3efc59cd0e4b6ebb12.webm?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/d646e19d8a2b5a3efc59cd0e4b6ebb12.mp4?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your city upwards, utilizing both trunk and bough.</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited horizontal space</strong> requires a strategy; construct zip lines and stairways to connect your growing settlement layers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage raw and processed resources</strong>, production facilities, and citizen morale, while fortifying defenses to withstand fog's creeping chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/871c795c3c6049086c1db1af8bd1a321.poster.avif?t=1784727657\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/871c795c3c6049086c1db1af8bd1a321.webm?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/871c795c3c6049086c1db1af8bd1a321.mp4?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fog  drives your citizens to madness and conceals stalking terrors.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight back by illuminating paths, crafting light-powered weapons</strong>, and mastering the raw energy of Solium.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push back the gloom</strong> and save your nation. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/e4866f37018a6946872b298b08213ed4.poster.avif?t=1784727657\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/e4866f37018a6946872b298b08213ed4.webm?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/e4866f37018a6946872b298b08213ed4.mp4?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Send scout detachments into the misty unknown to chart new airship routes.</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish far-outposts, and excavate rare resources and artifacts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange and lethal creatures lurking in the fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the remnants of an ancient civilization. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/519083327560fcfac200b237b4af9bac.poster.avif?t=1784727657\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/519083327560fcfac200b237b4af9bac.webm?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/519083327560fcfac200b237b4af9bac.mp4?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Shape your citizens' destiny through morally complex decisions</strong>. </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness various dramatic storylines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate choices where even small actions can spiral into grim consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/1764305358c5c248e2843cb270b4ed49.avif?t=1784727657\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode: 20+ hours</strong> of single-player, story-driven gameplay with quests, branching narratives, and high-stakes choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ unique buildings</strong> for full tree city customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 resource types</strong>: balance raw and processed goods to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 technology levels</strong> to advance and unlock new growth possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200-meter-tall tree</strong> that serves as the foundation for your city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric soundtrack </strong>composed by <strong>Akira Yamaoka</strong> (<i>Silent Hill</i> series).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/606c518046f94120af41c043fcb1290e.poster.avif?t=1784727657\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/606c518046f94120af41c043fcb1290e.webm?t=1784727657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "DarkSwitch is a vertical survival city builder. Build a city on a great tree and defend it against the Fog. Face the challenges of limited real estate, scarce resources, and tough moral choices as you seek to uncover the mystery of the Shroud. The Tree Provides! The Tree Protects! The Tree Prevails!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Polish, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, French, Kazakh<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The city building of Frostpunk 2 and survivalism of Endzone and Project Zomboid are unified in Dark Switch, with music by a gaming legend.”<br>PCGamesN<br><br>“Its aesthetic, branching narrative, and constant tension promise to offer more than just management: a desperate fight for sanity and light in a world forgotten by the sun”<br>3D Juegos <br><br>“I'm always up for a new twist on city-building, and the idea of constructing an elvish haven is certainly one that appeals.”<br>PC Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/42e93524103da65416bd88820f6f3438f283e728/header.jpg?t=1784727657", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/d98b442c21eb800b6dc588ed632bd407f51f4f02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784727657", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/d98b442c21eb800b6dc588ed632bd407f51f4f02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784727657", "website": "https://darkswitch.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 6600 (6+ ГБ VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Required</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core Ultra 7 265K / AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D<br></li><li><stron